@@ -60,6 +60,10 @@ permissions.
 - Added `promoCodeDetails` field to `CheckoutError`, `OrderError` and `OrderCreateFromCheckoutError`, explaining why a voucher or gift card code was rejected. It returns a `PromoCodeRejectionReason` (e.g. `EXPIRED`, `USAGE_LIMIT_REACHED`, `MIN_SPENT_NOT_REACHED`, `NO_ELIGIBLE_PRODUCTS`) plus `minSpent` / `minCheckoutItemsQuantity` where relevant. It is reported by `checkoutAddPromoCode`, `checkoutComplete`, `orderCreateFromCheckout`, `draftOrderCreate`, `draftOrderUpdate`, `draftOrderComplete` and `Order.errors`.
 - Added `externalReference` support to `Voucher`. Vouchers can now be created with an external reference, looked up using `voucher(externalReference: ...)`, and updated or deleted by external reference instead of ID. The reference can also be changed or cleared through `voucherUpdate`.
 - Added `externalReference` filter to `products(where: ...)`. Supports `eq` and `oneOf`, allowing products to be fetched in batch by their external references.
+- Added age-restricted products.
+  - `Product.isAgeRestricted` (settable through `ProductInput`) marks a product that only customers who reached the shop's minimum age can buy. `Shop.minimumAge` (default 18) and `Shop.timeZone` (default `UTC`, the time zone that defines "today" for the age check) are set through `shopSettingsUpdate`. Products stay visible; only buying is restricted.
+  - `User.birthday` can be set by the customer (`accountRegister`, `accountUpdate`) or by a superuser (`customerCreate`, `customerUpdate`). It is returned only to the account owner and superusers, never to apps, other staff, webhook payloads or exports. `User.isAgeEligible` (owner and staff with `MANAGE_USERS`) tells whether the customer reached the minimum age, and `User.isSuperuser` (owner only) tells whether the viewer is a superuser. Birthday changes and non-owner reads are recorded as `BIRTHDAY_CHANGED`, `BIRTHDAY_VIEWED` and `AGE_ELIGIBILITY_VIEWED` customer events, visible in `User.events` to superusers only.
+  - Lines of age-restricted products are checked when added to a checkout or draft order and again when the checkout is completed (`checkoutComplete`, `orderCreateFromCheckout`) or the draft order is completed (`draftOrderComplete`); completion is the authoritative check. Guest checkouts (no authenticated user) are rejected. New error codes: `AGE_RESTRICTION_LOGIN_REQUIRED`, `AGE_RESTRICTION_BIRTHDAY_REQUIRED` and `AGE_RESTRICTION_UNDERAGE` on `CheckoutErrorCode`, `CheckoutCreateFromOrderErrorCode` and `OrderCreateFromCheckoutErrorCode`; `AGE_RESTRICTION_BIRTHDAY_REQUIRED` and `AGE_RESTRICTION_UNDERAGE` on `OrderErrorCode`; `PERMISSION_DENIED` on `AccountErrorCode`.
 
